# Extra egress allowlist for the claude-code feature — what the CLI itself needs
# for auth, the API and telemetry. Merged into the firewall's list only while the
# feature is declared in devcontainer.json (which is also the only case where
# there is a firewall at all — init-firewall.sh belongs to this feature).
#
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config#network-access-requirements

api.anthropic.com
console.anthropic.com
claude.ai
sentry.io
# Claude Code's telemetry host is statsig.anthropic.com, but that name has no
# public A record; it lands on Statsig's CDN, which these two cover.
statsig.com
featuregates.org

# The observability stack — containers/observability/docker-compose.yml — which
# this feature pushes OTLP to (initialize.sh sets the OTEL_* variables).
#
# Belt and braces, and a record of what this feature talks to. The firewall
# already accepts every network the container is attached to, in both directions
# (see init-firewall.sh), and ../ensure-observability.sh attaches this one — so
# the line is not what makes the collector reachable. The CIDR is pinned on the
# other side; keep the two in sync.
172.29.0.0/24
